            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention relates to a solid form formulation comprising chromium (sucrosomial chromium&amp;lt;sup&amp;gt;®&amp;lt;/sup&amp;gt;) or copper (sucrosomial copper&amp;lt;sup&amp;gt;®&amp;lt;/sup&amp;gt;) or a vitamin (sucrosomial vitamin&amp;lt;sup&amp;gt;®&amp;lt;/sup&amp;gt;) and uses thereof. Furthermore, the present invention relates to a composition comprising said sucrosomial chromium&amp;lt;sup&amp;gt;®&amp;lt;/sup&amp;gt; and the use thereof in the treatment of a chromium deficiency and/or a change in the carbohydrate metabolism and/or a change in the muscle energy metabolism. Lastly, the present invention relates to a process for the preparation of said sucrosomial chromium&amp;lt;sup&amp;gt;®&amp;lt;/sup&amp;gt;.</p>
            </abstract>
